---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description={`The terms and conditions for using ${SITE.name} at ${SITE.url}.`}
  lede={`Please read these terms carefully before using ${SITE.name}.`}
  updated="June 2025"
>
  <p>
    By accessing and using <strong>{SITE.url}</strong> you accept and agree to be bound by these
    terms and conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of this site</h2>
  <p>
    The content on {SITE.name} is provided for general information and inspiration purposes only.
    You may browse, read and share articles for personal, non-commercial use. You may not reproduce,
    republish, scrape or redistribute our content without prior written permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    All original written content, design and code on this site is the property of {SITE.name} unless
    otherwise stated. Photography sourced from Unsplash and Pexels is used under their respective
    free licences; product images belong to their respective retailers.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Some articles contain affiliate links and the site displays advertising. Full details are in our
    <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure policy</a>. We are not responsible for the content, pricing or
    availability of third-party websites linked from this site.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>
    We make every effort to keep information accurate and up to date, but we cannot guarantee that
    all content is complete, current or error-free. Product prices, availability and specifications
    change frequently. Always verify details directly with the retailer or manufacturer before
    making a purchase.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of this site or reliance
    on its content. This includes, without limitation, direct, indirect or consequential loss. See
    our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> for further detail.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    This site links to external websites for your convenience. We have no control over the content
    of those sites and accept no responsibility for them or for any loss or damage that may arise
    from your use of them.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after any changes
    constitutes your acceptance of the new terms. The date above reflects the most recent revision.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable law. Any disputes
    relating to these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the relevant courts.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about these terms, please use the form on our
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
